'CI/CD task: Fix a slow and unsafe Playwright workflow

The following GitHub Actions workflow runs Playwright tests:

Rewrite the workflow to meet these requirements:

Use npm ci for reproducible dependency installation.
Cache npm dependencies.
Install Chromium and its required operating-system dependencies only.
Split the Playwright suite across four parallel shards.
Cancel older in-progress runs when a newer commit is pushed to the same branch or pull request.
Upload the Playwright report for every shard, including failed runs.
Prevent a hanging test job from running longer than 30 minutes.
Use minimum necessary GitHub token permissions.
Do not expose secrets to untrusted fork pull requests.

Provide the revised YAML and briefly explain how your design improves speed, reliability, and security.'

name: Playwright Tests

on:
  push:
  pull_request:

permissions:
  contents: read

concurrency:
  group: playwright-${{ github.workflow }}-${{ github.ref }}
  cancel-in-progress: true

jobs:
  test:
    timeout-minutes: 30
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    strategy:
      fail-fast: false
      matrix:
        shard: [1, 2, 3, 4]

    steps:
      - name: Checkout repository
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Set up Node
        uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: 22
          cache: npm

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: npm ci

      - name: Install Chromium
        run: npx playwright install chromium --with-deps

      - name: Run Playwright tests
        if: >
          github.event_name != 'pull_request' ||
          github.event.pull_request.head.repo.full_name == github.repository
        run: npx playwright test --shard=${{ matrix.shard }}/4
        env:
          TEST_USERNAME: ${{ secrets.TEST_USERNAME }}
          TEST_PASSWORD: ${{ secrets.TEST_PASSWORD }}

      - name: Upload Playwright report
        if: always()
        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
        with:
          name: playwright-report-shard-${{ matrix.shard }}
          path: playwright-report/
          if-no-files-found: ignore
          retention-days: 14